Upstream executable is unchanged. Deployment provides a fixed configuration and Landlock launcher.

An empty Git repository on main lives in DATA_DIR/workspace. Author and committer identity and timestamps are fixed. A root-owned system configuration disables external tools and background network activity; hooks and global Git configuration are disabled. Landlock restricts executable programs and writable directories; application state persists under DATA_DIR/.lazygit.

